---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SOCIAL_LINKS } from '../consts';
---

<BaseLayout title="关于 | Atom Blog">
  <section class="about">
    <div class="unified-page-header">
      <h1>关于我</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="about-content">
      <p>
        嗨，我是 <strong>zz3656</strong> 👋<br/>
        一个热爱技术的开发者，热衷于用简洁优雅的方式解决问题。
        这个博客以电影《铁甲钢拳》(Real Steel) 中的机器人
        <strong>Atom</strong> 命名 —
        小巧、精准、充满力量。
      </p>

      <h2>🛠️ 技术栈</h2>
      <div class="about-projects">
        <div class="project-card">
          <h3>⚡ 前端开发</h3>
          <p>Astro / React / TypeScript，追求极致的性能和用户体验。</p>
          <div class="project-links">
            <a href="https://astro.build" target="_blank" class="tag">Astro</a>
            <a href="https://react.dev" target="_blank" class="tag">React</a>
            <a href="https://www.typescriptlang.org" target="_blank" class="tag">TypeScript</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="project-card">
          <h3>🌐 部署与运维</h3>
          <p>GitHub Pages / Cloudflare Pages / Docker，让网站 7×24 在线。</p>
          <div class="project-links">
            <a href="https://pages.github.com" target="_blank" class="tag">GitHub Pages</a>
            <a href="https://pages.cloudflare.com" target="_blank" class="tag">Cloudflare</a>
            <a href="https://www.docker.com" target="_blank" class="tag">Docker</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="project-card">
          <h3>🔧 开发工具</h3>
          <p>Neovim / GitHub Actions / Shell Script，高效的工作流自动化。</p>
          <div class="project-links">
            <a href="https://github.com/features/actions" target="_blank" class="tag">GitHub Actions</a>
            <a href="https://neovim.io" target="_blank" class="tag">Neovim</a>
            <a href="https://www.gnu.org/software/bash/" target="_blank" class="tag">Bash</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <h2>📬 联系我</h2>
      <p>通过以下方式找到我，欢迎交流技术、分享想法。</p>
      <div class="about-links">
        {SOCIAL_LINKS.github && <a href={SOCIAL_LINKS.github} target="_blank" class="btn btn-secondary">GitHub</a>}
        {SOCIAL_LINKS.twitter && <a href={SOCIAL_LINKS.twitter} target="_blank" class="btn btn-secondary">Twitter</a>}
        {SOCIAL_LINKS.email && <a href={SOCIAL_LINKS.email} class="btn btn-secondary">Email</a>}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
